@NoContextHumans FYI:

Human Metapneumovirus (HMPV) is a common respiratory virus, which can be severe in young children, the elderly, and vulnerable individuals. 

It is an emerging issue in 2025. However, HMPV has been known since its discovery in 2001 and is not new in 2025.
